index a05889d..10a737d 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Fixed: booleans written with capitals (`True`, `YES`) were rejected. A value that is not a boolean now lists the accepted words.
 - `load()` takes `files`, a list of `(name, text)` pairs applied in order, instead of `file_text` and `file_name`.
 - Environment variables use one underscore between section and name (`LAYERCFG_SERVER_PORT`); the double-underscore spelling is now an unknown variable.
 - Durations are whole milliseconds (`int`) instead of float seconds; a duration finer than a millisecond is rejected.
